   "titulo": "Verbs with ter",
   "texto": [
    "**manter** (keep), **obter** (get), **conter** (contain), **reter** (retain), **deter** (stop). They are conjugated as **ter**: **mantenho** (maintenance), **obténs** (get), **obtém** (get).",
    "The prefix changes the meaning: **ter** (have), **manter** (maintain), **obter** (get)."
   ]
  },
